    {
      "id": "5a0e0017-0002-4c00-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Run Now",
      "notes": "Manual run for scripts/n8n-run.sh and the Task 17 test. A Webhook trigger instead of the brief's Manual trigger: `n8n execute` cannot run beside the live n8n process (it starts its own task broker on 5679, which the main process already holds). Same Header Auth credential as test-harness.",
